        <mxCell id="a-note" value="netfilx.md has no equivalent of VISIBLE — a title there is either fully TRANSCODING or fully READY. Here, watchable and fully-available are genuinely different states because uploaders expect the video live soon, not after every quality finishes." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
